ST  - Predictor@Home
UR  - https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/1652942
N1  - <p>The abstract identifies Predictor@Home as a BOINC-powered structure prediction system and reports improved sampling capacity. The paper compares CASP protein structures generated on P@H with those generated on a local cluster. Source: https://www.researchgate.net/publication/3301075_PredictorHome_A_Protein_Structure_Prediction_Supercomputer'_Based_on_Global_Computing</p>
